'''Hot Chocolate''' is an {{Uncommon}} item that grants the {{PotN|Obsidian Skin|hashlink=y}} effect.

== Obtaining ==
'''Hot Chocolate''' can be bought from [[Grog]] in {{Zone|Dragontail}} or [[Ezekiel]] in {{Zone|Scarleton}} for {{C|70k}}.

== {{TA|Obsidian Skin|}}Usage ==
'''Hot Chocolate''' can be consumed to gain the {{PotN|Obsidian Skin|hashlink=y}} effect for 2 minutes. This causes the player to not instantly die while touching the {{Zone|Blazing Volcano}}'s lava during an [[Eruption]], and instead take normal damage.

== Trivia ==
*The {{PotN|Obsidian Skin}} effect references the ''[[W:Terraria|Terraria]]'' [[Terraria:Obsidian Skin Potion|potion effect]] of the same name.

